uggesting older/viral content drove most views.\n106: \n107: ---\n108: \n109: ## 6. All 9 Channels — Final Comparison\n110: \n111: | Metric | Cineporty | StickmanTeck | Just Explained | Stickman 616 | Vericade | MARINARA | Rock in Space | Byte Sized | **Nemo** |\n112: |--------|-----------|-------------|---------------|-------------|---------|---------|-------------|-----------|---------|\n113: | **Niche** | Horror | Tech | Tech | MCU | MCU | GTA Kids | Myths | Tech | **GTA Kids** |\n114: | **Subs** | 12K | 5.16K | 31.4K | 21.1K | 71.7K | 109K | 337K | 183K | **21.8K** |\n115: | **Views** | 4.04M | 538K | 3.24M | 8.51M | 78.2M | 81.3M | 26.2M | 19.4M | **29.7M** |\n116: | **Videos** | 15 | 20 | 25 | 32 | 307 | 162 | 15 | 24 | **116** |\n117: | **Monetized** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | **❌** |\n118: | **Monthly Rev** | $3,323 | $1,681 | $13,118 | $8,636 | $548 | $74,948 | $4,887 | $8,150 | **$0** |\n119: | **Lifetime** | ~$10K | ~$3.2K | ~$19.7K | ~$21.9K | ~$30.5K | ~$161K | ~$85K | ~$112K | **$0** |\n120: \n121: > [!CAUTION]\n122: > **Nemo is the cautionary tale.** Same niche as MARINARA, 29.7M views, 6 months of daily work, and ZERO earnings. This proves the GTA kids niche is high-risk: if YouTube decides your content is repetitious, spam, or made-for-kids in the wrong way, you get nothing.\n123: \n124: ---\n125: \n126: ## Data Sources\n127: \n128: | Data Point | NexLev Tool Used | Status |\n129: |-----------|-----------------|--------|\n130: | Channel profile | `youtube_channel_about` | ✅ |\n131: | Monetization check | `check_channel_monetization` | ✅ (**NOT monetized**) |\n132: | RPM / Revenue / Demographics | `get_geography_revenue` | ❌ (rate limited 5/5 daily) |\n133: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
